# Marketing video source footage and renders. Screen recordings and gameplay B-roll are
# large binaries that change every time they are re-cut, and the rendered output is
# reproducible from them, so neither belongs in git history. The Remotion project's own
# source (compositions, hooks, config) is tracked normally; only these two trees are not.
marketing/video/public/footage/
marketing/video/out/
